          <a href="/about" class="block px-4 py-2 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-neon hover:bg-dark-hover"><svg class="w-5 h-5 inline-block" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg> About</a>
